  "claim": "An American independent motion picture company produced a 2015 mystery thriller film based on a novel by Tom Rob, written in 1999. The first project it produced was a movie in which Tom Degnan had an appearance.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Worldview Entertainment. Sentence: Worldview Entertainment is an American independent motion picture company that finances and produces theatrical quality feature films for worldwide distribution.\nPage: Worldview Entertainment. Sentence: Worldview has produced films including \"Child 44\", \"Birdman\", \"Blood Ties\", \"The Green Inferno\", and \"Killer Joe\".\nPage: Child 44 (film). Sentence: Child 44 is a 2015 mystery thriller film directed by Daniel Espinosa, written by Richard Price, and based on Tom Rob Smith's 2008 novel of the same name.\nPage: Handsome Harry. Sentence: The first project produced by Worldview Entertainment, it stars Jamey Sheridan, Steve Buscemi and Aidan Quinn.\nPage: Tom Degnan. Sentence: Additional appearances include \"Handsome Harry\", alongside Steve Buscemi, and \"Little Miss Perfect\", alongside Lilla Crawford.",
